WEBVTT

00:30:29.388 --> 00:30:32.618
and we really have to force them
to confront their own sinfulness.

00:30:32.642 --> 00:30:34.960
We really have to take
the battle right to them."

00:30:34.984 --> 00:30:37.387
So it was aggressive,
it was completely aggressive,

00:30:37.411 --> 00:30:39.415
but it was aggressive in a loving manner,

00:30:39.439 --> 00:30:41.392
in a way that you don't corrupt yourself

00:30:41.416 --> 00:30:45.150
and turn yourself into the mirror image
of hate and prejudice.

00:30:45.174 --> 00:30:51.369
CA: The sin wasn't perceived to be only
in the enemy, as it were -- outsiders.

00:30:51.393 --> 00:30:53.390
It was also believed to be within?

00:30:53.414 --> 00:30:54.574
DB: Right.

00:30:54.598 --> 00:30:58.138
And if you take sin seriously, you see it
as a common thing that radiates.

00:30:58.162 --> 00:31:00.799
I'll go back to an idea
we earlier discussed: